Rama grieves over fallen Lakshmana --- Rama renounces war life and Sita --- Sushena declares Lakshmana still breathes --- Sushena sends Hanuman to herb mountain --- Hanuman carries the whole peak back --- Sushena crushes herbs into Lakshmana nose --- Lakshmana rises pain-free from the ground --- Monkeys praise Sushena and Rama embraces Lakshmana --- Lakshmana rebukes despair and demands vow keeping --- Lakshmana urges Ravana death before sunset